いる場面を目撃し……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18307","sourceWorkId":"10758","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく元気がトレードマークの漫画研究会部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"精神的にはまだ幼さも残るが、部員たちの事や自身の将来の夢に対しては真っ直ぐ向き合っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"漫画研究会を発足し、仲間達と同人誌を製作している。将来の夢は漫画家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"漫画を馬鹿にしている文学部部長、秋山ゆきと対立しており、なにかと騒動を起こしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆきの色仕掛けを偶然目撃したことから、漫研を守る為、奉仕する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"143089"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/734179dda489ede8bfdc8c68a147df389f1342b36679ade7bd24bd3f7a92426e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9ec0389c2e0ac35c8a17ab6c9560427bba0dd0e017811ff1e6a01051432bb2e.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:464952:143089:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50807","characterName":"秋山 ゆき","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"143090","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"464952"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18308"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50807"},"originalCharacterName":"秋山 ゆき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀、知的な雰囲気を醸し出す「文学部」部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毎日、読書を欠かさないほど、文学を心から愛しているが、漫画は認めていないため、さくらの漫研とはトラブルが絶えない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"廃部を阻止しようと、自らの豊満な肉体で色仕掛けをしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お姉さんタイプで、常に主人公をリードしたエッチで責めまくるが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18308","sourceWorkId":"10758","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラマーで成績優秀な文学部部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文学を心から愛し、日々読書に勤しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"漫画を認めず、馬鹿にしていることから、漫画研究会とのトラブルは耐えない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豊満な肉体を駆使し、主人公に文学部を助けて貰おうと色仕掛けで迫ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にリードするお姉さんタイプだが、読書で睡眠不足となり、体育の授業中に倒れるといった、おちゃめな一面も。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"143090"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42336136ed79b9753d6d999e23bec2b6985c12d1613db3913f138de7465f9bc5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/cae86784d8dc0a70a74b74b7ff875c733f0ab3ec9811a2f9efd71e2fa77dfcab.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:464952:143090:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p4305","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2413","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4305","name":"もーにんぐらいと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:10758:2413","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p789","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p789","name":"もーにんぐ","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:42058:v2430","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p4305","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p4305","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4305","name":"もーにんぐ らいと","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:42059:v2430","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p789","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p789","name":"もーにんぐ","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:56